lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nA tea house has 30 different types of tea. The owner tells the customers that most are green tea, a small part are white tea and black tea. After tasting, the customer finds that only 2 types are black tea.\n\n[Question]\nPlease ask before the customer tastes, how many types does he guess are green tea?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before the customer tastes, he guesses that there are 10 types of green tea.\nB. Before the customer tastes, he guesses that there are 25 types of green tea.\nC. Before the customer tastes, he guesses that there are 28 types of green tea.\nD. Before the customer tastes, he guesses that there are 30 types of green tea.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002182638954302788,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af587309aa9dc5a833d4652","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475824356,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:30:24","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d38554bf99b546b295221e909f82cbfd"}